{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55618","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十六 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抱朴澄神蕴道光，石炉闲爇六时香。\n曳空横野云和静，逗石穿崖水自忙。\n晚圃雨来葵叶嫩，晴坡烧後蕨苗长。\n一心包尽乾坤内，莫把闲文更度量。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55618.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55618","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}